      "name": "unset_primary_name",
      "description": "Clears the primary name of the caller. The forward resolution (name -> address) is left untouched, only the reverse record (address -> name) is removed. The stored primary name is cleared even if it no longer resolves to the caller (e.g. the name was burned), so a later re-mint of the same name does not revive it. Reverts with `PrimaryNameNotSet` if the caller has no primary name stored.",
